enter gap-1.5 border-b border-amber-100 pb-2\">\n        <span>📍</span> 千葉県のエリア別・後悔回避宿特集\n      </h4>\n      <div class=\"space-y-2\">\n        \n          <a href=\"/posts/autumn-kanto-chiba-isobi-lobster-guide\" class=\"block group p-2.5 rounded-xl hover:bg-amber-50 transition border border-transparent hover:border-amber-200\">\n            <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-stone-800 group-hover:text-amber-700 transition line-clamp-1\">👉 【2026年最新】千葉・南房総 伊勢海老お造り＆鮑の踊り焼き・太平洋オーシャンビュー温泉旅館特集！</p>\n            <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-500 line-clamp-1\">館山・南房総</p>\n          </a>\n        \n          <a href=\"/posts/autumn-kanto-chiba-kamogawa-seafood-guide\" class=\"block group p-2.5 rounded-xl hover:bg-amber-50 transition border border-transparent hover:border-amber-200\">\n            <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-stone-800 group-hover:text-amber-700 transition line-clamp-1\">👉 【2026年最新】千葉 鴨川温泉 房州伊勢海老・あわび舞踊り＆太平洋を望む空中温泉スパリゾート特集！</p>\n            <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-500 line-clamp-1\">勝浦・鴨川</p>\n          </a>\n        \n          <a href=\"/posts/chiba-hotels-selection-guide\" class=\"block group p-2.5 rounded-xl hover:bg-amber-50 transition border border-transparent hover:border-amber-200\">\n            <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-stone-800 group-hover:text-amber-700 transition line-clamp-1\">👉 【2026年最新】千葉おすすめホテル・温泉リゾート10選！</p>\n            <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-500 line-clamp-1\">千葉県全域（舞浜浦安TDR・南房総館山鴨川・銚子九十九里・木更津鋸山）</p>\n          </a>\n        \n          <a href=\"/posts/choshi-kujukuri-narita-hotels-guide\" class=\"block group p-2.5 rounded-xl hover:bg-amber-50 transition border border-transparent hover:border-amber-200\">\n            <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-stone-800 group-hover:text-amber-700 transition line-clamp-1\">👉 【2026年最新】銚子・成田・九十九里おすすめ宿10選！</p>\n            <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-500 line-clamp-1\">銚子市・成田市・山武郡九十九里町（犬吠埼・屏風ヶ浦・成田山新勝寺・成田空港・九十九里浜）</p>\n          </a>\n        \n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- 近隣・隣接都道府県の人気特集 -->\n    <div class=\"p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-stone-200/90 shadow-sm space-y-3\">\n      <h4 class=\"text-xs font-black text-orange-900 flex items-center gap-1.5 border-b border-orange-100 pb-2\">\n        <span>🚗</span> 周遊・隣接エリアのおすすめ特集\n      </h4>\n      <div class=\"space-y-2\">\n        \n          <a href=\"/posts/ibaraki-hotels-selection-guide\" class=\"block group p-2.5 rounded-xl hover:bg-orange-50 transition border border-transparent hover:border-orange-200\">\n            <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-stone-800 group-hover:text-orange-700 transition line-clamp-1\">🏨 【茨城県】【2026年最新】茨城おすすめ温泉旅館・ホテル10選！</p>\n            <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-500 line-clamp-1\">茨城県全域（大洗ひたちなか海浜公園・筑波山つくば土浦・水戸偕楽園袋田の滝・北茨城五浦海岸鹿島）</p>\n          </a>\n        \n          <a href=\"/posts/saitama-hotels-selection-guide\" class=\"block group p-2.5 rounded-xl hover:bg-orange-50 transition border border-transparent hover:border-orange-200\">\n            <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-stone-800 group-hover:text-orange-700 transition line-clamp-1\">🏨 【埼玉県】【2026年最新】埼玉おすすめ温泉旅館・ホテル10選！</p>\n            <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-500 line-clamp-1\">埼玉県全域（秩父長瀞三峯神社・小江戸川越・大宮さいたま新都心浦和・飯能名栗温泉熊谷）</p>\n          </a>\n        \n          <a href=\"/posts/tokyo-hotels-selection-guide\" class=\"block group p-2.5 rounded-xl hover:bg-orange-50 transition border border-transparent hover:border-orange-200\">\n            <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-stone-800 group-hover:text-orange-700 transition line-clamp-1\">🏨 【東京都】【2026年最新】東京おすすめ高級ホテル・旅館10選！</p>\n            <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-500 line-clamp-1\">東京都全域（東京駅丸の内日本橋銀座・浅草上野スカイツリー・新宿渋谷六本木虎ノ門・お台場ベイエリア奥多摩）</p>\n          </a>\n        \n          <a href=\"/posts/kanagawa-hotels-selection-guide\" class=\"block group p-2.5 rounded-xl hover:bg-orange-50 transition border border-transparent hover:border-orange-200\">\n            <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-st